WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:05.500
And what a tremendous asset for the United Kingdom.

00:05.500 --> 00:07.800
And I hope the Prime Minister is listening

00:07.800 --> 00:10.300
because I told it to him three days in a row.

00:10.300 --> 00:11.440
That's all he heard.

00:11.440 --> 00:15.200
No sea oil, no sea, because I want to see them do well.

00:15.200 --> 00:16.800
I want to stop seeing them ruining

00:16.800 --> 00:20.000
that beautiful Scottish and English countryside.

